msgid "TeraVolt AeroTel 2.4 - Telemetry Radio"
msgstr "TeraVolt AeroTel 2.4 数传电台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:7 5025f2cbe6784466a49aab0041a057cc
#: 85de019456b1450c93bb8fb0562a04be 9333c703c85449709a53ac63e7b88eb0
#: d34bc1b7b6d04445b9aeb5fa1f41ff26 fefc23425c47444aaef899d9b40d7339
msgid ""
"The **AeroTel 2.4** by **TeraVolt Labs** is a professional, plug-and-play "
"telemetry module powered by the industry-proven **DroneBridge** "
"communication core."
msgstr ""
"**AeroTel 2.4** 是 **TeraVolt Labs** 推出的专业级即插即用数传模块，基于业界成熟的 **DroneBridge** "
"通信内核。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:9 07f9914e5d6e42a8a496ef2af0f15cae
#: ab1edb9d8c644f8a9f2a2a39ecbb59bf ab2cb82979bf49b184d29a981f127a8c
#: ad0d77b8925a41f388a568a6d357663e b18ec32afbed4ed595c2ef87582f9b31
msgid ""
"While standard DroneBridge boards require manual wiring and soldering, the "
"AeroTel 2.4 is engineered specifically for ArduPilot integration. It "
"features a custom \"mounting-friendly\" PCB, pre-installed JST-GH connectors"
" matching the Pixhawk standard, and dedicated onboard controls for mode "
"switching."
msgstr ""
"标准 DroneBridge 板需要手工接线焊接，而 AeroTel 2.4 专为 ArduPilot 集成而设计：定制的易安装 PCB、预装的 "
"Pixhawk 标准 JST-GH 连接器，以及板载的模式切换实体按键。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:16 2e7385acd90c41a7a7a74552bbb72d25
#: 6b890706194e4aa080745ba5e0bb4ea3 73086c239c524deaaf353179f6a78bdf
#: 978c57533a6e49eab36e4d2049bda740 a06ac625d4524d1490da98d3c4505a7d
