msgid ""
"**Plug & Play:** Pre-installed JST-GH 6-pin connector (Direct fit for "
"Pixhawk/Cube TELEM ports)."
msgstr "**即插即用：** 预装 JST-GH 6 针连接器（直插 Pixhawk/Cube 的 TELEM 口）。"

